<view class="container">
  <view class="hero"><view class="title">现场工作台</view><view>{{userName}} · {{date}}</view></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">当前项目</view>
    <picker range="{{projects}}" range-key="name" value="{{projectIndex}}" bindchange="selectProject"><view class="picker">{{projects[projectIndex].name || '暂无获授权项目'}}</view></picker>
    <view class="muted">开始记录前，请确认项目。离线时仅使用已缓存的获授权项目。</view>
    <view class="grid"><button wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="kind" class="primary" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="create">填写{{item.title}}</button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">管理与报表</view>
    <button data-url="/pages/project-documents/index?projectId={{projects[projectIndex].id}}" bindtap="go">工程资料 · 日记引用</button>
    <view class="grid"><button class="small" data-url="/pages/personnel/index" bindtap="go">人员管理</button><button class="small" data-url="/pages/departments/index" bindtap="go">部门管理</button><button class="small" data-url="/pages/reports/index" bindtap="go">报表统计</button></view>
    <view class="muted">人员与部门仅管理员可编辑；报表为只读汇总，详细分析请使用 PC 端。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{summary.length}}">
    <view class="label">今日可见记录摘要</view>
    <block wx:for="{{summary}}" wx:key="kind">
      <view wx:if="{{item.memo}}" class="muted">{{item.title}}：草稿 {{item.counts.draft}} · 已保存 {{item.counts.recorded}}</view>
      <view wx:else class="muted">{{item.title}}：草稿 {{item.counts.draft}} · 待审核 {{item.counts.submitted}} · 通过 {{item.counts.approved}} · 退回 {{item.counts.rejected}}</view>
    </block>
    <view class="muted">统计按本人及项目审核权限计算；巡检提交即保存为备忘，不产生审核待办。草稿不计为已提交。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row"><view class="label">本账号本机草稿</view><button class="small" loading="{{syncing}}" disabled="{{syncing}}" bindtap="sync">同步 / 重试</button></view>
    <view class="warning">未同步资料仅在本机。清理微信数据、换手机或卸载可能丢失；请及时联网同步。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="localId" class="card" data-id="{{item.localId}}" bindtap="openDraft">
      <view>{{item.projectName || '项目'}} · {{item.body.diaryDate || item.body.logDate || item.body.inspectionDate}}</view>
      <view class="badge">{{item.state}}</view><view class="error">{{item.error}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{!drafts.length}}">暂无本机草稿</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <button class="small" data-mode="mine" bindtap="mode">我的记录</button><button wx:if="{{canReview && kind !== 'daily-inspections'}}" class="small" data-mode="todo" bindtap="mode">项目待审核</button>
    <view><button wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="kind" class="small" data-kind="{{item.kind}}" bindtap="selectKind">{{item.title}}{{kind === item.kind ? ' ✓' : ''}}</button></view>
    <view class="label">{{mode === 'todo' ? '待审核' : '我的记录'}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view>{{item.code}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.diaryDate || item.logDate || item.inspectionDate}}</view><view class="badge">{{item.statusText}}</view></view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{!records.length}}">暂无记录</view>
    <button wx:if="{{more}}" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="more">加载更多</button><button bindtap="refresh">刷新</button>
  </view>
  <button bindtap="logout">退出登录</button>
</view>
